{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01466",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 6.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.67,
      "end_seconds": 12.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.35,
      "end_seconds": 25.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a red itchy lump on my arm. It's getting on my nerves now. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.06,
      "end_seconds": 30.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.41,
      "end_seconds": 34.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Probably three days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.96,
      "end_seconds": 38.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.1,
      "end_seconds": 54.93,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "It usually comes with mild swelling. The mild swelling? That's been for ten days. As for mild swelling, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 63.57,
      "end_seconds": 73.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 114 over 78, pulse is 80 beats a minute, temp 36.8 degrees, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.5,
      "end_seconds": 76.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.18,
      "end_seconds": 83.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "So, I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.7,
      "end_seconds": 85.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.52,
      "end_seconds": 106.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "There is a small red lump with a central punctum and a little swelling around it, and no spreading redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.47,
      "end_seconds": 116.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "So, all finished, thank you. Have you had any dizziness, fever, breathing trouble or lip swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.85,
      "end_seconds": 119.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.46,
      "end_seconds": 127.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.55,
      "end_seconds": 130.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.62,
      "end_seconds": 148.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.41,
      "end_seconds": 156.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.74,
      "end_seconds": 178.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.31,
      "end_seconds": 191.99,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity. Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. I take an antihistamine, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.01,
      "end_seconds": 199.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.4,
      "end_seconds": 205.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 212.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.5,
      "end_seconds": 217.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I've got acid reflux. Anxiety, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.75,
      "end_seconds": 225.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux and anxiety are known to us, good to have that clear. Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.59,
      "end_seconds": 231.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.0,
      "end_seconds": 234.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.7,
      "end_seconds": 240.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.94,
      "end_seconds": 243.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Alright, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.57,
      "end_seconds": 248.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.45,
      "end_seconds": 252.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.59,
      "end_seconds": 258.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.14,
      "end_seconds": 262.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.88,
      "end_seconds": 268.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.99,
      "end_seconds": 280.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a local insect bite reaction. I'd also keep early cellulitis in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.46,
      "end_seconds": 284.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.34,
      "end_seconds": 300.29,
      "duration_seconds": 13.95,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a local insect bite reaction. I'm prescribing hydrocortisone cream, 1%, twice a day, five days. That should help with bite reaction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.57,
      "end_seconds": 303.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Fine, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.3,
      "end_seconds": 319.94,
      "duration_seconds": 15.64,
      "text": "Cool it with ice and avoid scratching. If the redness spreads or you feel unwell, that's the point to come in urgently. I'd like you back if the redness spreads. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.12,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I mean, alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.34,
      "end_seconds": 327.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}